{"_doc":"Per letter id (order P, I…VIII, E): words = 8 lemma keys for the \"today's words\" card, chosen from that letter by chapter band (P/I–II: A1–A2, III–V: B1, VI–VIII/E: B2–C1; widened by one band only when needed), never repeating a lemma of an earlier letter; no names, function words, single letters or words spelled exactly like their English gloss. spots = [{i: plate spot index, w: lemma key, was: old spot word}] — a replacement only for weak spot words (names, pronouns, verb forms, cognates, letters); the lemma occurs in the quoted message and names something in the picture; [] when none is needed or none fits. phrases = 1–2 expressions copied verbatim from the letter: {t: text, m: message index, ko, en, note_ko, note_en}.","lang":"fr","letters":{"p1":{"words":["maladie","revoir","chambre","maison","jardin"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"chaque chambre de la maison","m":0,"ko":"그 집의 방 하나하나","en":"every room of the house","note_ko":"chaque + 단수 명사: '하나하나 모두'.","note_en":"chaque + singular noun: 'each and every'."}]},"p2":{"words":["couleur","noir","terre"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"moins noire que","m":0,"ko":"~보다 덜 어두운","en":"less dark than","note_ko":"moins + 형용사 + que: '~보다 덜 …한' (비교).","note_en":"moins + adjective + que: 'less … than'."}]},"p3":{"words":["vouloir","venir","partir","midi","tôt"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"tout d'un trait","m":0,"ko":"단숨에, 한달음에","en":"in one go","note_ko":"쉬지 않고 한 번에 해냈을 때.","note_en":"Said of doing something without stopping."},{"t":"à partir de midi","m":0,"ko":"정오부터","en":"from noon on","note_ko":"à partir de + 시간: '~부터'.","note_en":"à partir de + time: 'from … on'."}]},"p4":{"words":["pays","réellement","beau","autant"],"spots":[],"phrases":[{"t":"se prêterait autant à l'art","m":0,"ko":"그만큼 예술에 어울릴 것이다","en":"would lend itself just as well to art","note_ko":"se prêter à: '~에 알맞다, ~에 잘 맞다'.","note_en":"se prêter à: 'to lend itself to, to suit'."}]},"c1-l1":{"words":["voyage","penser","nouveau","voir","dire","tomber",